From e9d7e3beb0927ba6dfe70c14d32b6c452a46d17d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: muhiddinov <muhiddinovabulqosim@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:32:49 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] orangepi_zero3: add board support with Qt5/GStreamer kiosk
 app

Adds Orange Pi Zero3 (H618) board files on top of the local kernel/
u-boot/ATF source overrides (see local.mk): linux-extras.config kernel
fragment (AC200 MFD, Panfrost, PRCM power-domain, CLUT224 boot logo),
an auto-expanding rootfs first-boot script, SSH access, a full GPT
backup table in genimage.cfg, a near-fullscreen centered single-copy
boot logo + hidden text cursor on the kernel command line, forced
root/password SSH login in post-build.sh, and a trimmed-down rootfs
size (700M instead of 1G, matching actual usage) so the initial image
is smaller before the first-boot auto-expand takes over.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
